WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
That's what happened last night

2
00:00:02,230 --> 00:00:03,470
This old lady will come again

3
00:00:03,790 --> 00:00:04,950
She can't get into your bed

4
00:00:05,030 --> 00:00:06,230
I want to practice cultivation and eat incense again

5
00:00:06,270 --> 00:00:12,870
Who do you think she is most likely to molest, Brother Zheng Qiuqiu?

6
00:00:12,990 --> 00:00:14,910
Are you Zhang Guiying’s former Tang Dan? Who provided it?

7
00:00:15,070 --> 00:00:16,470
My dad got burned that day

8
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:18,830
They didn't believe it when I offered it before.

9
00:00:19,070 --> 00:00:20,260
Then it will burn if you die

10
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:22,880
Tang Dan was burned

11
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:25,200
Her ancestors above her had no place to live.

12
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:26,680
Those people will also suppress her

13
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:29,060
Then her family is obviously Baojiatang

14
00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:30,060
Why is it Red Tang Dan?

15
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:32,220
Either the person who set up the church for her has misjudged her.

16
00:00:32,860 --> 00:00:34,460
Or it was passed down from our ancestors.

17
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:35,660
Never changed

18
00:00:36,530 --> 00:00:37,810
Come as soon as possible after get off work

19
00:00:38,410 --> 00:00:40,010
You will probably come to see you again tonight

20
00:00:42,380 --> 00:00:44,220
I'll stay here tonight and squeeze in with Xiaotie

21
00:00:44,420 --> 00:00:46,340
If the old lady comes, she won't be able to cause trouble for you.

22
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:47,660
Xiaotie Uncle Liu

23
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:49,260
I have a serious job

24
00:00:49,260 --> 00:00:50,260
I have been timid since I was a child.

25
00:00:50,460 --> 00:00:51,460
half atheist

26
00:00:51,820 --> 00:00:53,460
But I don’t want my soul to fly apart

27
00:00:53,740 --> 00:00:55,820
Can you give her a proper placement? Don’t worry.

28
00:00:56,060 --> 00:00:58,500
As long as we're here and can't hurt her, that's fine.

29
00:00:58,820 --> 00:01:01,820
When I heard this, I felt at ease, Old Liu

30
00:01:02,380 --> 00:01:03,860
The ghost sent a message that the old lady is here

31
00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:05,340
I brought a lot of people this time

32
00:01:05,340 --> 00:01:06,820
You go first and hide in my room
